<div class="product__accordion accordion accordion--medium quick-add-hidden pdp-buybox-accordion" style="--margin-top: 2.4rem;--margin-bottom: 0.0rem;">
  <details class="accordion__details">
    <summary class="accordion__summary">
      <div class="summary__title">
        <h2 class="h4 accordion__title">How It Works</h2>
      </div>
      {% render 'icon-caret' %}
    </summary>
  </details>
  <div class="accordion__content-wrapper">
    <div class="accordion__content pdp-buybox-accordion__content">
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill">HOUR 1</span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text">Voles get within range. Their nervous system is immediately overwhelmed. They retreat.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill">DAY 3</span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text">Every entry point is blocked by an invisible scent barrier. They can't navigate. They can't communicate with other Voles.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill">WEEK 2</span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text">Their avoidance becomes permanent. Unlike poison - they can never build tolerance to this.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill">WEEK 3</span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text">They're gone. Completely abandoned your property. And they won't return.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="product__accordion accordion accordion--medium quick-add-hidden pdp-buybox-accordion" style="--margin-top: 2.4rem;--margin-bottom: 0.0rem;">
  <details class="accordion__details">
    <summary class="accordion__summary">
      <div class="summary__title">
        <h2 class="h4 accordion__title">Where To Place Them</h2>
      </div>
      {% render 'icon-caret' %}
    </summary>
  </details>
  <div class="accordion__content-wrapper">
    <div class="accordion__content pdp-buybox-accordion__content">
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill">&#127968; Home</span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text">Entry doors, under kitchen sink, behind appliances, basement corners, attic hatch, garage door edges</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill">&#128656; RV</span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text">Under seats, storage compartments, engine bay, wheel wells, exterior vents</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill">&#127806; Barn &amp; Farm</span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text">Feed storage areas, entry points, corners where walls meet floors, hay storage, roof beams</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pdp-buybox-accordion__card pdp-buybox-accordion__card--dark">
        <span class="pdp-buybox-accordion__pill pdp-buybox-accordion__pill--dark">
          <svg width="15" height="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 15 15" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
            <path d="M7.5 0C3.35476 0 0 3.35438 0 7.5C0 11.6452 3.35438 15 7.5 15C11.6452 15 15 11.6456 15 7.5C15 3.35481 11.6456 0 7.5 0ZM8.27019 10.4772C8.27019 10.7141 7.92466 10.951 7.50015 10.951C7.05589 10.951 6.74001 10.7141 6.74001 10.4772V6.71584C6.74001 6.43942 7.05592 6.25181 7.50015 6.25181C7.92466 6.25181 8.27019 6.43942 8.27019 6.71584V10.4772ZM7.50018 5.34363C7.04605 5.34363 6.69067 5.00798 6.69067 4.6328C6.69067 4.25766 7.04607 3.93187 7.50018 3.93187C7.94443 3.93187 8.29986 4.25766 8.29986 4.6328C8.29986 5.00798 7.9444 5.34363 7.50018 5.34363Z" fill="#CCF46F"/>
          </svg>
          PRO TIPS
        </span>
        <p class="pdp-buybox-accordion__text pdp-buybox-accordion__text--light">Place every 8-10 feet along known entry points for a complete invisible barrier. Replace every 90 days.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

